        flow("From potential outcomes to evidence", ["Define treatment strategies", "Choose target effect", "Align time zero and horizon", "Establish exchangeability and positivity", "Estimate observed-data contrast", "Assess interference, missingness and transport"], "Each step preserves the exact intervention and population named by the estimand.", "exchangeability-positivity"),
