        flow("IV evidence chain", ["Defend assignment independence", "Show first-stage treatment shift", "Show reduced-form outcome shift", "Assess exclusion and monotonicity", "Compute Wald or 2SLS", "Use weak-IV and cluster-aware inference"], "The ratio is credible only when every link in the design is visible.", "validity-reporting"),
