        {"question": "What if pretreatment fit is poor?", "answer": "The classical donor pool does not support the counterfactual well; redesign, narrow the claim or use a justified extension rather than trust the post gap."},
        {"question": "What does an in-space placebo do?", "answer": "It applies the full method to untreated donors as pseudo-treated units to contextualize how unusual the treated unit's post/pre divergence is."},
